@page "/"

<PageTitle>IFS Academy SCORM Editor</PageTitle>

<h3>IFS Academy SCORM Editor</h3>
<p class="text-muted">
    Open a SCORM package, change its pages in code or directly in the preview, check the LMS calls it makes, and export a new zip.
</p>

<div class="row g-3 mt-2">
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title"><span class="oi oi-pencil me-2" aria-hidden="true"></span>SCORM Editor</h5>
                <p class="card-text small text-muted">
                    Browse the package files, edit HTML, CSS, JavaScript and imsmanifest.xml with live preview, or type straight into the preview.
                </p>
                <a href="editor" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">Open</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title"><span class="oi oi-monitor me-2" aria-hidden="true"></span>LMS test run</h5>
                <p class="card-text small text-muted">
                    The preview stands in for the LMS. It answers SCORM 1.2 and 2004 API calls and shows status, score and every call made.
                </p>
                <a href="editor" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">Open</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h5 class="card-title"><span class="oi oi-data-transfer-download me-2" aria-hidden="true"></span>Export</h5>
                <p class="card-text small text-muted">
                    Download the edited package as a new zip, with imsmanifest.xml first, ready to upload to Cornerstone Saba or any SCORM LMS.
                </p>
                <a href="editor" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">Open</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
